== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|Bloody Mary}}.
* [[anti:Blood Oath|Blood Oath]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and by extension, from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.
** In ''Antibirth'', it was possible to prevent {{e|Red Heart}}s from being drained while still gaining the stat increases if Isaac's speed was high enough to immediately leave the starting room. Moreover any {{e|Rotten Heart}} Isaac had would cause Blood Oath to remove half of a {{e|Soul Heart}} which would kill him if he did not have one to remove, likely a bug.
** In ''Community Remix'', it would instead immediately give a damage bonus for each red health Isaac doesn't have.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>
*** It would start with giving Isaac a 1.8 damage up, and then decrease it by 0.085 for each half red heart Isaac has, meaning at 10.5 red hearts it would start to be a damage down.
* The familiar appears much bloodier when a large amount of hearts are drained.

